        "original_id": "22abdaa4-cdbf-5722-a0b8-c5180f64b461",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tommy Faile\n- Places: Brown Mountain, North Carolina, Wiseman's View, Linville Falls\n- Works: \"Phantom 309\", \"The Legend of the Brown Mountain Lights\"\n- Topics: Brown Mountain Lights\n\nFacts:\n- Tommy Faile was an American songwriter and singer who lived from September 15, 1928 to August 2, 1998.\n- Tommy Faile was best known for composing \"Phantom 309\" and singing \"The Legend of the Brown Mountain Lights\".\n- The Brown Mountain Lights are a series of ghost lights reported near Brown Mountain in North Carolina.\n- Wiseman's View is one of the best vantage points for the Brown Mountain Lights and is about 4 miles from Linville Falls, North Carolina.",
